      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Optimize capture for audio coming from the side of the device facing the user. In the typical case, a device with a single screen, screen-side camera/microphone and non-screen-side camera/microphone, this will be the screen side (as in a "selfie"). For a different device geometry, it is the side for which the expectation is to be facing the user.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/media/MicrophoneDirection#MIC_DIRECTION_TOWARDS_USER" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.media.MicrophoneDirection.MIC_DIRECTION_TOWARDS_USER</code>.</a></format></para>
